{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/GIF_CHARACTERS.gif?t=1749133187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anything that kills you becomes playable for your next runs.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be tempted to die on purpose in a successful run to unlock the enemy you face? Dying is more bittersweet when the boss that took you down becomes the instrument of your revenge.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With dozens of playable characters, you\u2019ll find your favorite playstyle. Play to its strengths, go beyond Hell or above Heaven, and discover why you\u2019re stuck in the Purgatory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost In Prayer's characters have: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Specific equipment slots:</strong> Not every loot will be useful for your character. <i>Sadly, our big turtle-like guy, the Godly Terapin, can\u2019t fit any chest armor on him.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique skill sets to unlock</strong>: You can play the same character in different ways thanks to a wide skill tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/GIF_COMBOS_2.gif?t=1749133187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The odds are stacked against you</strong>, so whether it is part of your environment or a combination of your abilities, seize any opportunities to gain the upper hand. You\u2019ll need it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create deadly Combos. </strong>Leave a burning circle at every step, swap your place with your enemy, and push them into traps using the Tango skill. Freeze enemies where they are before launching an area-of-effect attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create the perfect outcome for you with Lost In Prayer's extensive skill system:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pull an enemy</strong> into the projectile of its allies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build up your Power</strong> at every step before inflicting a deadly blow to that pesky demon. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Push that pretentious Angel</strong> into burning lava with a well-placed headbutt. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use hit-and-run tactics</strong> to inflict damage at every step before heroically escaping to the other side of the room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hit multiple enemies</strong> in your line of sight with a deadly ranged attack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/GIF_EXPLORE_01.gif?t=1749133187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With their own inhabitants, environments, traps, and quirks, Heaven and Hell propose radically different experiences. You\u2019ll need to explore both to unlock all characters in Lost In Prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So <strong>if you\u2019re tired of dying in one route,</strong> try your luck and skills with the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter the path you choose, every floor will challenge you more than the last. <strong>Victory is going to be a hell of a challenge.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2849500?t=1749133187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749133187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749133187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749133187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3138110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/GIF_CHARACTERS.gif?t=1749133187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anything that kills you becomes playable for your next runs.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be tempted to die on purpose in a successful run to unlock the enemy you face? Dying is more bittersweet when the boss that took you down becomes the instrument of your revenge.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With dozens of playable characters, you\u2019ll find your favorite playstyle. Play to its strengths, go beyond Hell or above Heaven, and discover why you\u2019re stuck in the Purgatory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost In Prayer's characters have: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Specific equipment slots:</strong> Not every loot will be useful for your character. <i>Sadly, our big turtle-like guy, the Godly Terapin, can\u2019t fit any chest armor on him.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique skill sets to unlock</strong>: You can play the same character in different ways thanks to a wide skill tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/GIF_COMBOS_2.gif?t=1749133187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The odds are stacked against you</strong>, so whether it is part of your environment or a combination of your abilities, seize any opportunities to gain the upper hand. You\u2019ll need it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create deadly Combos. </strong>Leave a burning circle at every step, swap your place with your enemy, and push them into traps using the Tango skill. Freeze enemies where they are before launching an area-of-effect attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create the perfect outcome for you with Lost In Prayer's extensive skill system:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pull an enemy</strong> into the projectile of its allies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build up your Power</strong> at every step before inflicting a deadly blow to that pesky demon. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Push that pretentious Angel</strong> into burning lava with a well-placed headbutt. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use hit-and-run tactics</strong> to inflict damage at every step before heroically escaping to the other side of the room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hit multiple enemies</strong> in your line of sight with a deadly ranged attack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/GIF_EXPLORE_01.gif?t=1749133187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With their own inhabitants, environments, traps, and quirks, Heaven and Hell propose radically different experiences. You\u2019ll need to explore both to unlock all characters in Lost In Prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So <strong>if you\u2019re tired of dying in one route,</strong> try your luck and skills with the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter the path you choose, every floor will challenge you more than the last. <strong>Victory is going to be a hell of a challenge.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Nine Dots Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/header.jpg?t=1749133187","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Nine Dots Studio, 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146408,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146408/movie480.mp4?t=1748452437","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146408/movie_max.mp4?t=1748452437"},"name":"Release Date Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146408/cc71f81f887a2796fa4fc76ec745478dd3de7557/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748452437","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146408/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748452437","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146408/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748452437"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257143536,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143536/movie480.mp4?t=1748012816","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143536/movie_max.mp4?t=1748012816"},"name":"Gameplay Walkthrough","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143536/8cbf85813accfb726c7c0afad5658f4448dc6ebd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748012816","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143536/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748012816","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143536/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748012816"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257097557,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097557/movie480.mp