rough Hell or Heaven \u2014 or die trying. When you die (and you will), you unlock a new creature, with a unique skill set and multiple playstyles to master. The challenge is to survive, yet the reward lies in dying","steam_appid":2849500,"support_info":{"email":"info@ninedotsstudio.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, German, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.ninedotsstudio.com/"}